{"build":"4b9ed06@15/11/2026, 10:40:41","data":{"book":{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Livro de Kirtan","subtitle":"Seva Ashram, Campos do Jordão","slug":"pt","language":"pt-BR","sort_order":4,"songsCount":112},{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Pocket Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Nabadwip, 2013","slug":"en-pe","language":"en","sort_order":7,"songsCount":80},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":8,"hidden":true,"songsCount":166},{"title":"Колесница Джаганнатха","subtitle":"Утренняя программа","slug":"ru-kdm","language":"ru","hidden":true,"render":{"tg.contents.page_number":false},"sort_order":9,"songsCount":23}],"nav":{"53":{"prev":{"path":"/en/gurudeva-kripa-bindu-diya-kara-ei-dase/","title":"Gurudeva!"},"next":{"path":"/en/jiv-jago-jiv-jago-gaurachanda-bole/","title":"Aruṇodaya-kīrtan – Part Two"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":53,"author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur","first_line":"udila aruṇa pūrava-bhāge"},"title":["Aruṇodaya-kīrtan"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"subtitle":["Part One"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["            udila aruṇa pūrava-bhāge","            dvija-maṇi gorā amani jāge","            bhakata-samūha la-iyā sāthe","(gorā) gelā nagara-vrāje"],"translation":["Just before sunrise, as the eastern sky turned crimson, the jewel of the twice-born, Śrī Gaurahari, awoke. Taking His devotees with Him, He began the kīrtan, wandering through the countryside towns and villages."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["            ‘tāthai’ ‘tāthai’ bājala khola","            ghana ghana tāhe jhā̐jera rola","            preme ḍhala ḍhala sonāra aṅga","(gorār) charaṇe nūpura bāje"],"translation":["The mṛdaṅgas went “tāthai tāthai” to the rhyming chiming of the cymbals, as Mahāprabhu’s golden form shivered in ecstasy and His footbells jingled."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["mukunda mādhava yādava hari","balare balare vadana bhari’","michhe nida-vaśe gela re rāti","divasa śarīra-sāje"],"translation":["Mahāprabhu would call out to the still sleeping people, “Don’t waste your nights uselessly sleeping and your days decorating your bodies! Cry out the Names Mukunda, Mādhava, Jādava, and Hari!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["emana durlabha mānava-deha","pāiyā ki kara bhāvanā keha","ebe nā bhajile yaśodā-suta","charame paḍibe lāje"],"translation":["“You have attained this rare human form of life. What are you doing? Don’t you care for this gift? If you don’t worship the darling of Mother Yaśodā now, then great sorrow awaits you at the time of death."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["udita tapana ha-ile asta","dina gela bali’ ha-ibe vyasta","tabe kena ebe alasa ha-i’","nā bhaja hṛdaya-rāje"],"translation":["“With every rising and setting of the sun, a day passes and is lost. Why then do you remain idle, refusing to serve the Lord of the heart?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["jīvana anitya jānaha sāra","tāhe nānā-vidha vipada-bhāra","nāmāśraya kari’ yatane tumi","thākaha āpana kāje"],"translation":["“Know for certain that this life is full of various miseries. Take shelter of the Holy Name as your only business.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["kṛṣṇa-nāma-sudhā kariyā pāna","juḍāo bhakati-vinoda-prāṇa","nāma vinā kichhu nāhika āra","chaudda-bhuvana-mājhe"],"translation":["Drink the pure nectar of the Holy Name of Kṛṣṇa, and thus satisfy the soul of Ṭhākur Bhakti Vinod. There is nothing but the Name to be had in all the fourteen worlds."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["jīvera kalyāṇa-sādhana-kāma","jagate āsi’ e madhura nāma","avidyā-timira-tapana-rūpe","hṛd-gagane virāje"],"translation":["To penetrate the darkness of ignorance and bless all souls within this universe, the beautiful Name of Kṛṣṇa has arisen like the shining sun."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-udilo-aruna-jiv","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/udilo-aruna-jiv-jago","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Aruṇodoya-kīrtan-02-22-4"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/udilo-aruna-puraba-bhage/","description":"Aruṇodaya-kīrtan — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Aruṇodaya-kīrtan. Part One | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"udilo-aruna-puraba-bhage"}}